  "$comment": "Account writer protocol shared by server/execution/account-writer.mjs and server/execution/account_writer.py. tests/account-writer-protocol.test.mjs reads the codes both sides raise and replays every scenario on both. Hashes and account keys are values existing ledgers already store: changing one needs a new protocol version, not a vector update. A failing step prints the value the implementation returned. Every error code is either expected by a vector step or listed in notVectored with the reason.",
